&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Barde.html&quot; title=&quot;Le barde&quot;&gt;Barde&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt; Le barde consid&#232;re son niveau comme plus haut de 1/2 niveau quand il s’agit de d&#233;terminer les effets de la &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Barde.html#REPRESENTATIONBARDIQUE&quot; title=&quot;Le barde&quot;&gt;repr&#233;sentation bardique`&lt;/a&gt; de &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Repr&#233;sentations.html#FASCINATION&quot; title=&quot;Les repr&#233;sentations bardiques du barde&quot;&gt;fascination&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Advanced Race Guide, Elves of Golarion, Gnomes of Golarion, Goblins of Golarion, Halflings of Golarion, Humans of Golarion, Dwarves of Golarion, Orcs of Golarion/Manuel des races&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoMR.gif&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Chevalier.html&quot; title=&quot;Le chevalier&quot;&gt;Chevalier&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt; Le chevalier rajoute 1,5 m&#232;tre (jusqu’&#224; 4,5 m&#232;tres maximum) &#224; la vitesse de sa &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Chevalier.html#MONTURE&quot; title=&quot;Le chevalier&quot;&gt;monture&lt;/a&gt; quand elle &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Actions-Sp&#233;ciales#Charge.html&quot; title=&quot;charge&quot;&gt;charge&lt;/a&gt; ou &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Actions-Complexes#Retraite.html&quot; title=&quot;battre en retraite&quot;&gt;bat en retraite&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
